      "expected": "Source main pp3–4 supports terminal-alkyne activation by ZnII/prolinate with carbonate base, an alkynylZn intermediate, coupling with alkynyl bromide with formingC–C/breakingC–Br and catalyst/ligand regeneration through Cs-prolinate. Account for CsHCO3 and CsBr and the ligand reservoir, with Zn remaining formally+2. Require genuine coupling connection and chemically supported regeneration; do not invent a mandatory separate regeneration saddle absent from source. Source Int2 is plotted+9.6 but SI component arithmetic on the balanced reference gives~4.08; record this SOURCE discrepancy rather than demanding both values or declaring a fabricated match.",
